{"overview":"دوره تایشو در ژاپن است. تانجیرو، پسر مهربانی که برای امرار معاش زغال می‌فروشد، خانواده‌اش را می‌بیند که توسط یک شیطان سلاخی شده‌اند. بدتر از همه، خواهر کوچکترش نزوکو، تنها بازمانده، خود به یک شیطان تبدیل شده است. اگرچه تانجیرو از این واقعیت تلخ شوکه شده است، اما تصمیم می‌گیرد که تبدیل به یک «شیطان‌کش» شود تا بتواند خواهرش را دوباره به یک انسان تبدیل کند و شیطانی که خانواده او را قتل عام کرد، بکشد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"After a demon attack leaves his family slain and his sister cursed, Tanjiro embarks upon a perilous journey to find a cure and avenge those he's lost.","tagline_en":"The love of a brother transcends everything.","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":18,"y":2020,"poster":"/hQIdXOUMMzfe3Utpa9v83uV3pdq.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":26,"y":2019,"poster":"/8a1XJJijOhH0SuDHslaCWZjxVNM.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":7,"y":2021,"poster":"/vJnV4NpKZWewtxOrUVU2S0wUPRx.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":11,"y":2021,"poster":"/aAjU9lDHMKYt0uq4CTmDhal7IMu.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":11,"y":2023,"poster":"/x3CN47K0GiFdmQqhipIWmTqSJGN.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":8,"y":2024,"poster":"/pBw3fbxBwtM6GPwgGqdkpbkzhNS.jpg"}],"episodes":63,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"花江夏樹","role":"Tanjirō Kamado (voice)","photo":"/alTb0DlcPIbcwM08WSmxFai58sd.jpg","en":"Natsuki Hanae"},{"name":"鬼頭明里","role":"Nezuko Kamado (voice)","photo":"/AoRQOZRC0yINB0WeKnM569rV1wF.jpg","en":"Akari Kito"},{"name":"下野紘","role":"Zenitsu Agatsuma (voice)","photo":"/yrSDcgFefHtWkFmLnTrcw2t0MV.jpg","en":"Hiro Shimono"},{"name":"松岡禎丞","role":"Inosuke Hashibira (voice)","photo":"/ugDwdWEXnmv43jcbnfAi4XwiQ8C.jpg","en":"Yoshitsugu Matsuoka"}],"trailer":"6MSY8_acauE","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/85937/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Hulu","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/44uAnmSqvA4yBOdbPWN8YgQHjWm.png"},{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":